# A simple alias for yt-dlp (or youtube-dl or any other project carrying the mantle — opaquely to the caller).
# Things got complicated enough with cookies and js runtimes that I've just specified those here.

yt-dlp --js-runtime node --remote-components ejs:github "$@" # No --cookies-from-browser firefox here since I don't have that set up on my machine at time of writing.
